</div> <div id="tab-panel-167" aria-labelledby="tab-167" role="tabpanel"> <p>Use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">cu128</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=cu128"><div></div></button></div></figure></div> </div><div id="tab-panel-168" aria-labelledby="tab-168" role="tabpanel" hidden> <p>Use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">xpu</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=xpu"><div></div></button></div></figure></div> </div><div id="tab-panel-169" aria-labelledby="tab-169" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden> <p>Do not use a torch backend.</p> </div>  </starlight-tabs>  <script type="module">class r extends HTMLElement{static#e=new Map;#t;#n="starlight-synced-tabs__";constructor(){super();const t=this.querySelector('[role="tablist"]');if(this.tabs=[...t.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]')],this.panels=[...this.querySelectorAll(':scope > [role="tabpanel"]')],this.#t=this.dataset.syncKey,this.#t){const i=r.#e.get(this.#t)??[];i.push(this),r.#e.set(this.#t,i)}this.tabs.forEach((i,c)=>{i.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.preventDefault();const n=t.querySelector('[aria-selected="true"]');e.currentTarget!==n&&this.switchTab(e.currentTarget,c)}),i.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{const n=this.tabs.indexOf(e.currentTarget),s=e.key==="ArrowLeft"?n-1:e.key==="ArrowRight"?n+1:e.key==="Home"?0:e.key==="End"?this.tabs.length-1:null;s!==null&&this.tabs[s]&&(e.preventDefault(),this.switchTab(this.tabs[s],s))})})}switchTab(t,i,c=!0){if(!t)return;const e=c?this.getBoundingClientRect().top:0;this.tabs.forEach(s=>{s.setAttribute("aria-selected","false"),s.setAttribute("tabindex","-1")}),this.panels.forEach(s=>{s.hidden=!0});const n=this.panels[i];n&&(n.hidden=!1),t.removeAttribute("tabindex"),t.setAttribute("aria-selected","true"),c&&(t.focus(),r.#r(this,t),window.scrollTo({top:window.scrollY+(this.getBoundingClientRect().top-e),behavior:"instant"}))}#i(t){!this.#t||typeof localStorage>"u"||localStorage.setItem(this.#n+this.#t,t)}static#r(t,i){const c=t.#t,e=r.#s(i);if(!c||!e)return;const n=r.#e.get(c);if(n){for(const s of n){if(s===t)continue;const a=s.tabs.findIndex(o=>r.#s(o)===e);a!==-1&&s.switchTab(s.tabs[a],a,!1)}t.#i(e)}}static#s(t){return t.textContent?.trim()}}customElements.define("starlight-tabs",r);</script> </div><div id="tab-panel-182" aria-labelledby="tab-182" role="tabpanel" hidden> <starlight-tabs data-sync-key="unixGpuType" class="astro-fpc45rav"> <div class="tablist-wrapper not-content astro-fpc45rav"> <ul role="tablist" class="astro-fpc45rav"> <li role="presentation" class="tab astro-fpc45rav"> <a role="tab" href="#tab-panel-170" id="tab-170" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="astro-fpc45rav">  Linux + Nvidia GPU </a> </li><li role="presentation" class="tab astro-fpc45rav"> <a role="tab" href="#tab-panel-171" id="tab-171" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="astro-fpc45rav">  Linux + no GPU </a> </li><li role="presentation" class="tab astro-fpc45rav"> <a role="tab" href="#tab-panel-172" id="tab-172" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="astro-fpc45rav">  Linux + AMD GPU </a> </li><li role="presentation" class="tab astro-fpc45rav"> <a role="tab" href="#tab-panel-173" id="tab-173" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="astro-fpc45rav">  Linux + Intel Arc GPU </a> </li><li role="presentation" class="tab astro-fpc45rav"> <a role="tab" href="#tab-panel-174" id="tab-174" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="astro-fpc45rav">  All other cases </a> </li> </ul> </div> <div id="tab-panel-170" aria-labelledby="tab-170" role="tabpanel"> <p>Use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">cu128</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=cu128"><div></div></button></div></figure></div> </div><div id="tab-panel-171" aria-labelledby="tab-171" role="tabpanel" hidden> <p>On <code dir="auto">x86_64</code>, use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">cpu</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=cpu"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>On ARM64 (<code dir="auto">aarch64</code>, e.g. Raspberry Pi 5), do <strong>not</strong> use a torch backend — PyTorch’s <code dir="auto">cpu</code> index has no ARM64 torchvision wheels. The default PyPI wheels are CPU-only on ARM64 and work out of the box.</p> </div><div id="tab-panel-172" aria-labelledby="tab-172" role="tabpanel" hidden> <p>Use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">rocm7.1</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=rocm7.1"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><aside aria-label="ROCm and torch 2.12" class="starlight-aside starlight-aside--caution"><p class="starlight-aside__title" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="starlight-aside__icon"><path d="M12 16C11.8022 16 11.6089 16.0587 11.4444 16.1686C11.28 16.2784 11.1518 16.4346 11.0761 16.6173C11.0004 16.8001 10.9806 17.0011 11.0192 17.1951C11.0578 17.3891 11.153 17.5673 11.2929 17.7071C11.4327 17.847 11.6109 17.9422 11.8049 17.9808C11.9989 18.0194 12.2 17.9996 12.3827 17.9239C12.5654 17.8482 12.7216 17.72 12.8315 17.5556C12.9413 17.3911 13 17.1978 13 17C13 16.7348 12.8946 16.4805 12.7071 16.2929C12.5196 16.1054 12.2652 16 12 16ZM22.67 17.47L14.62 3.47003C14.3598 3.00354 13.9798 2.61498 13.5192 2.3445C13.0586 2.07401 12.5341 1.9314 12 1.9314C11.4659 1.9314 10.9414 2.07401 10.4808 2.3445C10.0202 2.61498 9.64019 3.00354 9.38 3.47003L1.38 17.47C1.11079 17.924 0.966141 18.441 0.960643 18.9688C0.955144 19.4966 1.089 20.0166 1.34868 20.4761C1.60837 20.9356 1.9847 21.3185 2.43968 21.5861C2.89466 21.8536 3.41218 21.9964 3.94 22H20.06C20.5921 22.0053 21.1159 21.8689 21.5779 21.6049C22.0399 21.341 22.4234 20.9589 22.689 20.4978C22.9546 20.0368 23.0928 19.5134 23.0895 18.9814C23.0862 18.4493 22.9414 17.9277 22.67 17.47ZM20.94 19.47C20.8523 19.626 20.7245 19.7556 20.5697 19.8453C20.4149 19.935 20.2389 19.9815 20.06 19.98H3.94C3.76111 19.9815 3.5851 19.935 3.43032 19.8453C3.27553 19.7556 3.14765 19.626 3.06 19.47C2.97223 19.318 2.92602 19.1456 2.92602 18.97C2.92602 18.7945 2.97223 18.622 3.06 18.47L11.06 4.47003C11.1439 4.30623 11.2714 4.16876 11.4284 4.07277C11.5855 3.97678 11.766 3.92599 11.95 3.92599C12.134 3.92599 12.3145 3.97678 12.4716 4.07277C12.6286 4.16876 12.7561 4.30623 12.84 4.47003L20.89 18.47C20.9892 18.6199 21.0462 18.7937 21.055 18.9732C21.0638 19.1527 21.0241 19.3312 20.94 19.49V19.47ZM12 8.00003C11.7348 8.00003 11.4804 8.10538 11.2929 8.29292C11.1054 8.48046 11 8.73481 11 9.00003V13C11 13.2652 11.1054 13.5196 11.2929 13.7071C11.4804 13.8947 11.7348 14 12 14C12.2652 14 12.5196 13.8947 12.7071 13.7071C12.8946 13.5196 13 13.2652 13 13V9.00003C13 8.73481 12.8946 8.48046 12.7071 8.29292C12.5196 8.10538 12.2652 8.00003 12 8.00003Z"></path></svg>ROCm and torch 2.12</p><div class="starlight-aside__content"><p>The <code dir="auto">rocm7.1</code> index currently defaults to torch 2.12.x, which has been reported to
break generation on ROCm (<a href="https://github.com/invoke-ai/InvokeAI/issues/9410">#9410</a>).
Until that issue is closed, also constrain torch when installing:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">uv</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">pip</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">install</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">&#x3C;PACKAGE_SPECIFIER>==&#x3C;VERSION></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">"</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">torch&#x3C;2.12</span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">--python</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">3.12</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">--python-preference</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">only-managed</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend=rocm7.1</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">--force-reinstall</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="uv pip install <PACKAGE_SPECIFIER>==<VERSION> &#x22;torch<2.12&#x22; --python 3.12 --python-preference only-managed --torch-backend=rocm7.1 --force-reinstall"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>This workaround applies to the reported ROCm case only.</p></div></aside> </div><div id="tab-panel-173" aria-labelledby="tab-173" role="tabpanel" hidden> <p>Use:</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame is-terminal not-content"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title"></span><span class="sr-only">Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre data-language="sh"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C5E478;--1:#3B61B0">--torch-backend</span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">xpu</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="--torch-backend=xpu"><div></div></button></div></figure></div> </div><div id="tab-panel-174" aria-labelledby="tab-174" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden> <p>Do not use a torch backend.</p> </div> <starlight-tabs-restore class="astro-fpc45rav"></starlight-tabs-restore> </starlight-tabs>   </div> <starlight-tabs-restore class="astro-fpc45rav"></starlight-tabs-restore> </starlight-tabs>  
</li>
<li>
<p>Install the <code dir="auto">invokeai</code> package. Substitute the package specifier and version.</p>
